flowchart TD
  A["Prepare reply"] --> B["Detect user language"]
  B --> C["Answer or result first"]
  C --> D["Match depth to question"]
  D --> E["Strip filler"]
  E --> F{"Task changed things?"}
  F -- yes --> G["Report: Result / Changed / Verified / Risks / Next"]
  F -- no --> H["Short prose"]
  G & H --> I["Send"]
